reviews.text:
I went to Darin’s for a gel manicure and I’m very happy with the service I received! I was met with a warm welcome, shown to a massage chair and made comfortable. My manicurist (Miew I think it was spelt!) was wonderful, such attention to detail, made sure we were both happy at each stage of my appointment. She checked I liked the colour after it was applied to my first nail, made sure I was comfortable and happy throughout. A wonderful experience and a salon I will recommend to others and use again whilst on my long term stay in Thailand!
For reference;
Gel manicure with one colour cost 600Baht
